<title>FRANCE: Rouen Jan 1-15 grain exports at 187,661 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Jan 1-15 grain exports at 187,661 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen were 187,661 tonnes between January 1 and January 15, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 418,000 tonnes in the whole of January 1996.</p>
<p>The 187,661 tonnes included 137,807 tonnes of wheat and 49,854 tonnes of barley.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes).</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		    6,500</p>
<p>    Canary Islands		13,100</p>
<p>    Cuba			    23,141</p>
<p>    Britain			  7,365</p>
<p>    Ireland			  1,500</p>
<p>    Italy			   68,701</p>
<p>    Morocco			 10,500</p>
<p>    Turkey			   7,000</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>    Saudi Arabia		  47,400</p>
<p>    Italy			    2,454</p>
